Z||000016||artherd||10-10-2001||02:41 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by x-thumpr-x:<BR><B><BR>Joyride (roxette)<BR></B><P>OH YEAH!<BR><B><BR>Get Into My Car (Billy Ocean)<BR>Danger Zone (Kenny Loggins)<BR></B><BR> OH YEAH OH YEAH!Q!!<P><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  <P>My Fiero is driving great, what is it about pulling 2500 *constantly* for a hundred miles that makes them run so well?  Seating the rings?  Warming the gearbox oil?  Storing up Fiero Redline Mojo?!<P>Whatever it is, she's been good to me!!<P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P><BR>Lets see how many others we can come up with to create a mix selection for those long cruises on the open highway.[/B]<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||1
